{"id":"wb-7-1490","name":"拜吐拉清真寺宣礼塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"拜吐拉清真寺宣礼塔","text":"拜吐拉清真寺宣礼塔，又称解放南路清真寺宣礼塔，是伊宁市解放南路清真寺（原拜吐拉清真寺）的宣礼塔，也是该清真寺现存唯一的清代单体建筑，全国重点文物保护单位。宣礼塔为清代中原建筑风格建筑，外形从鼓楼演变而来，是占地约160平方米的四层砖木结构建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8B%9C%E5%90%90%E6%8B%89%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA%E5%AE%A3%E7%A4%BC%E5%A1%94","revisionId":89863893,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89863893","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/559a7c8dd0f8818276a6e14f.jpg","title":"解放南路清真寺（拜吐拉清真寺）宣礼塔（东侧）.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE%E5%8D%97%E8%B7%AF%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9C%E5%90%90%E6%8B%89%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA%EF%BC%89%E5%AE%A3%E7%A4%BC%E5%A1%94%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%9C%E4%BE%A7%EF%BC%89.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE%E5%8D%97%E8%B7%AF%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9C%E5%90%90%E6%8B%89%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA%EF%BC%89%E5%AE%A3%E7%A4%BC%E5%A1%94%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%9C%E4%BE%A7%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​解放南路清真寺（拜吐拉清真寺）宣礼塔（东侧）","width":320,"height":427}}